        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, at grid
Distribution losses are taken from Itten, Frischknecht and Stucki (2014): LCI of Electricity Mixes and Grid.; UUID:c4a92617-9f99-3d7b-95c0-15fb110b80ad
This dataset describes the distribution of the consumer mix 2019 in Switzerland and includes the low voltage network infrastructure, transmission losses and air pollutant emissions. Not included are electricity losses due to building distribution.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c4a92617-9f99-3d7b-95c0-15fb110b80ad.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
